  "description": {
    "en": "GAMMA Synthetic Gut is an all-around performance string designed for players of every level and playing style. Wearguard fibres protect the exterior of the string, helping reduce friction and notching while increasing durability. Its balanced combination of power, control, comfort and durability makes it a practical choice for recreational play, club competition and training.",

    "zh": "GAMMA Synthetic Gut 是一款适合各种水平和打法的全能型合成肠线，在力量、控制、舒适性与耐久性之间取得良好平衡。Wearguard 耐磨纤维覆盖球线外层，可降低球线之间的摩擦和切槽磨损，从而提升使用寿命。非常适合初学者、俱乐部球员、训练用拍以及希望获得高性价比穿线方案的用户。"
  },

